{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0aa0b65f02ee3b42dfe38614ee655503bc8228426783a76bf9a1f4de952c22c9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The agent runs a multi-stage pipeline feeding each stage's findings into the next: recon→exploit→walkthrough for CTF, and asset discovery→vulnerability identification→report for pentests."},{"claim_ids":["clm_71c63e4fdf4272f8941489692d91c21aecb9f5f1b7cca9c830771412ade09ada"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI accepts --target, --instruction, --mode pentest, --list-sessions, and --no-telemetry flags per documented usage examples."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9d82c69ad2cbb14816ad8601a700952d72d5d1973664182c5d005cadb670fca3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The legacy CLI exposes --reasoning-model/--parsing-model selection, --base-url for Ollama, --list-models rendering a live registry, and --smoke-test producing a pass/fail matrix."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a25d06f4c07643c6df8d8017e275a482c7dc1eee1e4e738e0c3ffbe04ca9f7ea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Telemetry sends anonymous usage data (session metadata, tool-usage patterns, flag-found events) to Langfuse, and can be disabled via --no-telemetry or LANGFUSE_ENABLED=false."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b443f826503820b6584542c0e15851301ba5630f0800bc2020549b67d3ce92ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The legacy interactive mode talks natively to many providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, DeepSeek, xAI, Qwen, Moonshot, Ollama) via official SDKs, configured through per-provider API keys."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fbc13657badf933c0d1f1ffe782e56e956f1fa3cf44671e37a63de42798a50dd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A historical December 2025 XBOW validation-suite run reported an 86.5% success rate (90/104); the README notes this is not a current regression guarantee and the harness lives outside this repo."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0aa0b65f02ee3b42dfe38614ee655503bc8228426783a76bf9a1f4de952c22c9","clm_71c63e4fdf4272f8941489692d91c21aecb9f5f1b7cca9c830771412ade09ada","clm_9d82c69ad2cbb1481